          <li><strong class="text-gray-800">Route density.</strong> Leads concentrated in the neighborhoods you already serve, not scattered across the county.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-gray-800">Recurring over one-off.</strong> Maintenance contracts that renew, not a single cleanup that never calls back.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-gray-800">Ticket size.</strong> Visibility for install, hardscape and irrigation work, not only "cheap lawn mowing."</li>
          <li><strong class="text-gray-800">Fewer price shoppers.</strong> Pages that answer the expensive questions and filter out the ones hunting for the lowest number.</li>
        </ul>
